reason: structured-metadata-unobservable
detail: `label_replace(count_over_time({service_name="api"}[5m]), "newlabel", "$1", "service_name", "(.+)")` answers with cerberus's synthesised `detected_level` label, which upstream produces at ingestion and the in-process querier therefore never carries
